│ Generate an improved HA specification that better matches the observed       │
│ trajectory data.                                                             │
│ - **Keep `var: "x1, x2"` and `input: ""` exactly as shown!**                 │
│ - Make sure the HA specification is valid and complete according to the JSON │
│ Schema.                                                                      │
│ - Refine the HA specification to improve trajectory matching and reduce `Max │
│ Difference`, `Mean Difference`, and `TC (Change-Point Error)`.               │
