│ 5. Fit (a2, b2, c2) for Mode 2 using Least Squares.                          │
│ 6. Check if Mode 2 constant c2 should be 0 (the system seems to converge to  │
│ the origin).                                                                 │
│ 7. Report the coefficients with high precision (at least 6 decimal places)   │
