  - $x_2[k+1] \approx -0.0098 x_1[k] + 0.9815 x_2[k] + 0.0000$ ($d \approx 
-0.010, e \approx 0.982, f \approx 0.000$)

**3. Verification of $x_1$ Relationship:**
The requirement $x_1[k+1] \approx x_2[k]$ ($a=0, b=1, c=0$) was checked. In the 
provided data, $x_1[k+1]$ is instead approximately $x_1[k] + 0.001 x_2[k]$. This
indicates that $x_2$ represents the derivative of $x_1$ scaled by $dt=0.001$, 
